OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,FA politician on the Isle of Man has
OL,7,Fdied overnight, after passing away
OL,8,F'peacefully in his sleep'.
OL,10,FJohn Wannenburgh MHK represented the
OL,11,Fconstituency of Douglas North, after
OL,12,Fbeing elected into the House of Keys
OL,13,Fin 2021.
OL,15,FFellow Douglas North MHK David Ashford
OL,16,Fposted on social media describing Mr
OL,17,FWannenburgh as a 'one of the kindest,
OL,18,Fwarm hearted people I have ever had
OL,19,Fthe privilege to know'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,F'He had the biggest heart of anyone I
OL,7,Fhave ever met and his very presence
OL,8,Fcould cheer someone up in their
OL,9,Fdarkest moments", he added.
OL,11,FPaying tribute to Mr Wannenburgh,
OL,12,FChief Minister Alfred Cannan MHK,
OL,13,Fsaid: 'John's passing is a significant
OL,14,Floss to our Island. He served the
OL,15,Fpeople of the Isle of Man with
OL,16,Fcommitment, integrity and a genuine
OL,17,Fsense of public duty.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,F'He was widely respected for his
OL,7,Fcontribution to public life,
OL,8,Fparticularly as member for Douglas
OL,9,FNorth where he worked as a steadfast
OL,10,Fadvocate for his constituents.
OL,12,F'John always listened, offered support
OL,13,Fand worked to improve the lives of
OL,14,Fthose he served. In his role as
OL,15,FDepartment Member within both the
OL,16,FDepartment of Home Affairs and the
OL,17,FDepartment of Environment, Food and
OL,18,FAgriculture, I know Ministers and
OL,19,Fcolleagues alike valued his scrutiny
OL,20,Fand insight.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,F'John also served the Isle of Man as
OL,7,FChair of the Manx Utilities Authority
OL,8,Ffrom 2023. He was a formidable Chair
OL,9,Fand a strong advocate for progress
OL,10,Ftowards the Island's renewable energy
OL,11,Fambitions, helping to drive forward
OL,12,Fpolicies within the Authority to
OL,13,Fsupport those objectives.
OL,15,F'On behalf of the Council of Ministers
OL,16,Fand people across the Island, I extend
OL,17,Fmy deepest condolences to John's
OL,18,Ffamily, friends, colleagues and to all
OL,19,Fthose whose lives he touched.'
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,FWriting to members of the Manx
OL,7,Fparliament, President of Tynwald, Juan
OL,8,FWatterson said: "John rose to fame on
OL,9,Fthe Island with his legendary Sports
OL,10,Fand Dining Club, which not only
OL,11,Fattracted fascinating people to the
OL,12,FIsland, but has raised over #250,000
OL,13,Ffor charity.
OL,15,FHe continued: "John took his politics
OL,16,Fseriously, and prided himself on being
OL,17,Fstraight talking but was also the life
OL,18,Fand soul of any party, with great
OL,19,Fstories of the celebrities from all
OL,20,Fwalks of life that he had got to know.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,FIn 2023, Mr Wannenburgh also became
OL,7,Fthe Chair of the Manx Utilities
OL,8,FAuthority, which is a statutory board
OL,9,Fof the Isle of Man Government.
OL,11,FAdrian Dobbins, Executive Director of
OL,12,FManx Utilities said: 'Manx Utilities
OL,13,Fis deeply saddened to learn of the
OL,14,Fpassing of our Chair, John Wannenburgh
OL,15,FMHK. On behalf of the Board,
OL,16,Fmanagement and all employees, we
OL,17,Fextend our sincere condolences to
OL,18,FJohn's family, friends and colleagues
OL,19,Fat this difficult time.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785842360
OL,3,CTributes paid to Isle of Man
OL,4,Cpolitician John Wannenburgh MHK
OL,6,F'John provided outstanding leadership
OL,7,Fand guidance to the organisation as
OL,8,FChair, bringing a strong commitment to
OL,9,Fpublic service and helping to shape
OL,10,Fthe strategic direction of Manx
OL,11,FUtilities. His wisdom, dedication and
OL,12,Fvalued contribution to the Board will
OL,13,Fbe greatly missed, and he will be
OL,14,Fremembered with both respect and
OL,15,Fgratitude.'
OL,17,FLast night, Mr Wannenburgh attended
OL,18,Fthe Summerland memorial service
OL,19,Fmarking the 53rd anniversary of the
OL,20,Ffire.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
